# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public repository policy for Heroes3-AI-Lab
# The lab itself keeps raw evidence, game data, models and repairs on disk.
# Git tracks source, reports, manifests and audit summaries only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Personal / unrelated material and the upstream engine checkout.
.research/
vcmi/
handoff/

# Model weights and exported runtimes (kept in the lab, listed by manifests).
models/**/*.pt
models/**/*.pth
models/**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.onnx
**/*.npz

